  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a celestial messenger, a member of the angelic host with a unique link to you, allowing them to carry a special message to the mortal world at your side. Most angel eidolons are roughly humanoid in form, with feathered wings, glowing eyes, halos, or similar angelic features. However, some take the form of smaller angelic servitors like the winged helmet cassisian angel instead. The two of you are destined for an important role in the plans of the celestial realms. Though a true angel, your angel eidolon's link to you as a mortal prevents them from casting the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-anachronism.spells.Item.joEruBVz31Uxczzq]{Angelic Messenger} ritual, even if they somehow learn it.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> divine</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> angel, celestial, eidolon, holy</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> Elysium, Heaven, or Nirvana</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> fist (bludgeoning), wing (bludgeoning), unarmed attacks shaped like a weapon</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> Con +1, Int –1, Wis +1, Cha +2</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Diplomacy, Religion</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> Empyrean</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><p><strong>Eidolon Abilities</strong> Initial @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.WyN2qQ2AP4cOMNxF]{Hallowed Strikes}; Symbiosis @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.6uCSkTAltByUK2Pb]{Traveler's Aura}; Transcendence @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.sf-AC-Features.Item.QDtXuIshSTUBcxff]{Angelic Mercy}</p>"
    },
